# pushnav
===
 Cross-platform plate-solving push-to for manual telescopes. ~$50 in hardware, works under heavy urban light pollution. Live tracking to Stellarium, SkySafari, INDI, ASCOM via LX200 or run standalone with built-in catalog. No encoders, no motors, no GOTO mount required.
